{"3789460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heaven Sent", "steam_appid": 3789460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789460/extras/3bd8da36978a8fcd955697fb4b3ed9ff.poster.avif?t=1765904328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789460/extras/3bd8da36978a8fcd955697fb4b3ed9ff.webm?t=1765904328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789460/extras/3bd8da36978a8fcd955697fb4b3ed9ff.mp4?t=1765904328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your ship. Experience true zero-G dogfighting — <strong>and give ’em heaven!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Heaven Sent</strong> is a thrilling, realistic, space combat simulator. Play for free in thrilling online battles with your own endlessly-customizable spacecraft. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT YOUR FIGHTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a fuselage, engines, wings, and more spacecraft parts get the look you want. Choose the weapons you'll use to annihilate the Opposition. Then head out to battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789460/extras/b100aeebbc582336bb206bced65d3f2f.poster.avif?t=1765904328\" width=1170 height=760 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789460/extras/b100aeebbc582336bb206bced65d3f2f.webm?t=1765904328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE ONLINE</h2><p clas